  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Blue food cooperation with Mexico</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project concerns an initial pilot project phase focused on assessing the ecological carrying capacity of aquaculture applying state-of-the-art tools to provide a comprehensive overview of production capacity, ecosystem impacts and ecosystem services at different spatial-temporal scales of present and future aquaculture activities under changing environmental conditions (climate change and other anthropogenic changes).</narrative>
  </description>
